{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119053","id":4345213560,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7WcDV_","number":119053,"title":"Fix area light texture color conversion","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-28T17:59:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T21:29:02Z","closed_at":"2026-04-29T17:34:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119053","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119053.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119053.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-29T17:34:16Z"},"body":"This PR fixes the color conversion specifically for mip 0 of the area light textures.\r\n\r\nFrom what I understand, the texture passed to the `area_texture` property is in sRGB. When it is copied to the atlas, the conversion to linear space is not performed, which causes the texture to look washed out when rendered.\r\n\r\n|Washed out ❌|Correct ✅|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17e9474f-3388-4353-95b0-27ad5e4ea60f\" />|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aefe47cc-88c2-4db6-81b4-d192268e052d\" />|\r\n\r\n|Atlas Mip 0 (sRGB)|Atlas Mip 0 (Linear)|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"256\" height=\"256\" alt=\"atlas_before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/295f5985-f356-43e8-be7a-4c04cdd98e82\" />|<img width=\"256\" height=\"256\" alt=\"atlas_after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7bf504b-3b97-45b9-9fbb-76161c39a947\" />|\r\n\r\nThis does not happen with the mipmaps because the conversion to linear is handled during the Gaussian filter application. This results in an inconsistency when transitioning from mip 0 to mip 1.\r\n\r\n|Mip transition|Atlas Mip 1 (Linear)|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"256\" height=\"150\" alt=\"before2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d84e344b-70ae-4920-90e0-d60896047b2d\" />|<img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"mip\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1730a2db-eb5a-4350-959b-9a1e61f2fbb8\" />|\r\n\r\nThe solution I implemented was using `rd_texture_srgb` instead of `rd_texture`. While it might not be the ideal approach, it is simple and practical.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119053/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}